--- !u!114 &1004194158
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1004194153}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 40746370ac7c82949909cf9467444f01, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  documents:
  - document: {fileID: 2130458222}
    innerMonologueText: Standard perimeter check. I've signed a hundred of these..
    approveText: '"Standard perimeter check. I''ve signed a hundred of these."'
    holdText: "\"The order is to stamp everything. I could lose everything if I don\u2019t."
    lessonTitle: 
    lessonDescription: 
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff3ff931721faf94a8c0e3791e61b169, type: 3}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 25ffa7490563067428ab0bf58d29ea6c, type: 3}
    holdSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b39a0108f0b38c74699293681fb276cb, type: 3}
  - document: {fileID: 1756386562}
    innerMonologueText: Shutting down the frequencies. So units can't hear what's
      happening at Crame
    approveText: Approve
    holdText: "\"The order is to stamp everything. I could lose everything if I don\u2019t."
    lessonTitle: 
    lessonDescription: 
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d7222b00a7465a4291cc950846296c1, type: 3}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea74d4fde85c7844a9550b7dace3cb68, type: 3}
    holdSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7c7131aac55070448b31680a3cf7c048, type: 3}
  - document: {fileID: 1474734789}
    innerMonologueText: 
    approveText: Approve
    holdText: "\"The order is to stamp everything. I could lose everything if I don\u2019t."
    lessonTitle: Media Control at EDSA
    lessonDescription: "On the night of February 22, government forces moved to restrict
      press access to military installations. Despite this, international media \u2014
      and eventually local independent journalists \u2014 continued to cover the
      unfolding events at EDSA. The attempt to exclude witnesses failed in part because
      the crowd itself was so large that suppression became impossible."
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 0}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e1959a0161444a409934a1671e7d12c, type: 3}
    holdSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b15a0a22ee809c4495e4f7d015d0f63, type: 3}
  - document: {fileID: 827242588}
    innerMonologueText: "LOGISTICS DIRECTIVE \u2014 All armored vehicles to be fueled
      and positioned at staging area by 2200H. Crews on standby. Signed: Base Commander."
    approveText: Approve
    holdText: "\"The order is to stamp everything. I could lose everything if I don\u2019t."
    lessonTitle: 
    lessonDescription: 
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f53df5f1f92658946a0db148636e53a6, type: 3}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bf6c7bef4eabec4f9335a1c397dc44a, type: 3}
    holdSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b32e1b5cd391614390a704344f178fa, type: 3}
  - document: {fileID: 773760861}
    innerMonologueText: Accountability. They want to know who's still here. Who might
      be thinking about crossing.
    approveText: Approve
    holdText: "\"The order is to stamp everything. I could lose everything if I don\u2019t."
    lessonTitle: 
    lessonDescription: 
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbb6de3f499c0b14a8196c1eaca3955b, type: 3}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93a7e12a71913de4d8d8b14aaea1104a, type: 3}
    holdSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 844a85749d819304087732796b9e31df, type: 3}
  - document: {fileID: 1156378585}
    innerMonologueText: Treat participants accordingly. The crowd on EDSA. The nuns.
      The students. The families with children. Treat them accordingly.
    approveText: Approve
    holdText: "\"The order is to stamp everything. I could lose everything if I don\u2019t."
    lessonTitle: ' Designating Civilians as Enemies'
    lessonDescription: "The language used in orders during EDSA \u2014 framing the
      civilian crowd as a security threat \u2014 echoed the same framing used since
      Martial Law, when protesters were routinely designated as communist subversives.
      The designation was the first legal step toward authorizing force. Several
      unit commanders later said this order was the one that clarified for them which
      side they were on."
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: af52a887191a96e4eab7549f2b3b0a82, type: 3}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31754b4756c736241aeffcbb8c2044c8, type: 3}
